(text "ZERO socket pin-1/model registration and external USB VBUS blocking require final qualification." (at 12.7 256 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid f7f439e6-eee6-512f-9c51-722df6241113))
(text "S3 GPIO43/44 (D6/D7) no longer connect to a radar: ROM UART is kept off sensor RX." (at 12.7 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid cfb24bb5-4b16-5dac-b5aa-9ced1567cc50))
(text "Radar RX inputs on S3 GPIO4/8/9 and RP GPIO5: input only, disable all pull-ups." (at 12.7 264 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 02b8f436-1e84-5c2a-8d61-6d43b63e202d))
(text "Both CD4052 VCC pins use AON 5V. EN must be active-HIGH INHIBIT at module pin 12." (at 12.7 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 062f8a3e-6a1f-5a4d-93c5-90d80e36e7fb))
(text "M2 OFF -> NC supplies AON 5V to both EN pins. ON -> NC open, module pulldowns enable." (at 12.7 272 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid b529dea4-2ce3-553d-910b-df6f435d3eec))
(text "Before M2 ON set four TX pins high-Z; wait for radar power to settle, then start UART." (at 12.7 276 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 2a061bff-bbf1-5911-99a0-87ea6d5090a3))
